Input Data to generate panelB are in folder:

/Figure_4/Raw_data
using the # xFC1 # yFC1 # zFC1 # xFC2 # yFC2 # zFC2 # xFC3 # yFC3 # zFC3 # columns from the input files (with FC1 = P, FC2 = A, FC3 = B) to measure pairwise distances between the loci.

How to:
Run the script Figure_4b_IJ.R located in the Figure_4/PanelB folder to recreate panelB and its related statistics.
